<title>USA: Vulcan Materials names Donald James CEO.</title>
<headline>Vulcan Materials names Donald James CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vulcan Materials Co said on Friday that its president, Donald James, has taken on the duties of chief executive, succeeding Herbert Sklenar.</p>
<p>Sklenar, 65, will remain chairman until May, when he will retire and James will become chairman.</p>
<p>James, 48, has been Vulcan's president and chief operating officer since February 1996.</p>
<p>Vulcan makes materials and commodities for the chemical, paper and water-treatment industries.</p>
<p>		  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
